1,1,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I think it is important that we pick a plan that can actually be finished on time. Does the ground here make it hard to build?,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"Let's be real, the biggest disaster is always the bill three years later. I want to know what this will actually cost to maintain once the party's over.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely to see you all. I worry that beautiful drawings often hide a fragile reality. I would prefer to see how our previous projects have aged.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with the need for realism. However, I am wondering who will actually be on the ground every day. A plan is only as good as the people managing it.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"You're all thinking about the ""what"" and ""who."" I'm thinking about the ""where."" A park isn't a drawing; it's a place that gets rained on and walked through.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, that's true. I just worry that if the diggers find something strange in the dirt, the whole project might stop for a long time.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, delays are annoying, but a permanent budget leak is a nightmare. I'm looking for a plan that doesn't bleed the city dry every single year.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, you are quite right to be cautious. But sometimes the cheapest option at the start is the most expensive in the end because it breaks so quickly.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Exactly. If we design something complex but have no one to prune the hedges or clean the paths, the park will just become a wasteland.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Precisely. If we ignore how people actually cross the grass or how the water drains in August, we're just buying a very expensive piece of art that doesn't work.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I want to learn more about the companies that do the digging. Maybe they can tell us if the plan is too difficult for this specific place.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I'm more interested in the ledger. I want to see exactly how much we've been spending per hectare. Let's get some hard numbers on the table.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I think I shall look into the condition of our earlier works. It is the best way to see if the city's promises of quality are actually kept.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I want to understand the current staffing. I'll look into the groundskeeping roll and see if we have any volunteer groups we can actually rely on.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll stick to the physical reality. I want to see the drainage callouts and the actual counts of how people move through the space on weekdays.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we can find a plan that makes everyone happy and doesn't take too many years to finish.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,"As long as it doesn't bankrupt the maintenance fund, I'm open to a little charm. Let's see what the data says.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us be gentle with one another as we decide. I just want a park that our grandchildren can still enjoy in fifty years.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I will be looking for a plan that is sustainable for the people, not just the budget.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's just make sure we don't pick a plan that looks great in a brochure but turns into a swamp the first time it rains.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,1,,action,Minato,,Regional firms tendering for earth-moving; Depot phasing notes on hoarding the site,"{""action"":""investigate"",""cards"":[""card_03"",""card_04""],""parse"":""ok""}"
